.claude/skills/hallmark/references/dark-mode.md:49:Both modes run the full gate sweep: contrast gates 40-41 on every pairing in both modes (the render tier only sees the default mode; check the dark pairings numerically), gate 7a and 7b (no pure black or white) bind on the dark block too, and the stamp records `modes: light+dark` so the log knows.
